    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Ash longbow with a gently recurved limb profile, a leather-bound central grip, brass nocks at both tips and a taut string. The limb taper and the string attachment are correct in the front, top and end-on views, and the string is real thin geometry rather than a texture. Materials score 4 for flat wood colour. Free-standing weapon, unrigged.",
    "limitations": [
      "The string and limbs are one fused mesh, so the bow cannot be drawn without adding a rig or shape keys.",
      "No arrows are included; the quiver is a separate asset."
    ],
